DUSD::setBurnerStatus
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when setting burner status to true for new address
    │   ├── it should set allowedBurner mapping to true
    │   └── it should emit SetBurnerStatus event
    ├── when setting burner status to false for existing burner
    │   ├── it should set allowedBurner mapping to false
    │   └── it should emit SetBurnerStatus event
    ├── when setting same status (true to true)
    │   ├── it should update the mapping
    │   └── it should emit SetBurnerStatus event
    └── when setting same status (false to false)
        ├── it should update the mapping
        └── it should emit SetBurnerStatus event